<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oakley FY97 EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oakley FY97 EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Gruntal &amp; Co said Friday it lowered its FY97 earnings per share estimate on Oakley Inc after the company reported below-consensus Q1 earnings of $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>--Gruntal cut its FY97 estimate to $0.48 from $0.60. It also dropped its FY98 estimate to $0.62 from $0.72.</p>
<p>--It also repeated a neutral rating on the stock.</p>
<p>--Oakley Inc, a manufacturer of sport sunglasses and goggles, ended up 3/4 at 11-3/4.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
